<title>UK: Norcros H1 pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Norcros H1 pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		28.5		   vs 9.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.0		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     51.2		   vs 18.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   115.4		  vs 159.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Norcros Plc said the pretax profit included a profit of 45.8 million stg on the sale of PP Payne and Nor Systems  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 6.9		    vs 10.4</p>
<p> Tax			  1.2		    vs 1.2</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 3, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Dec 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Norcros is a printing, packaging and ceramics group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
